<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Bilingual Vocabulary Document</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: #000000;
  }
  .container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .left-col {
    width: 76%;
    padding-right: 15px;
  }
  .right-col {
    width: 22%;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .en {
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .zh {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .zh u {
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .vocab {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .hl-green { background-color: #d9ead3; }
  .hl-orange { background-color: #fce5cd; }
  .hl-yellow { background-color: #fff2cc; }
  .hl-pink { background-color: #f4cccc; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <div class="left-col">
    <p class="zh"><u>此外，社会、教育和文化<span class="hl-green">促使强化某些关于孤独的</span><span class="hl-orange">非理性信</span>念。</u></p>

    <p class="en">Society has a <span class="hl-orange">tendency</span> to think that if someone is 40 years old and living alone, there's something wrong.</p>
    <p class="zh"><u>社会有一种<span class="hl-orange">倾向</span>，如果一个人40岁了，仍在独自生活，那就有问题了。</u></p>

    <p class="en">However, it should be realized that the central problem tends to be the belief <span class="hl-orange">surrounding</span> it.</p>
    <p class="zh"><u>然而，应该认识到，核心问题往往是<span class="hl-orange">围绕它</span>的信念。</u></p>

    <p class="en">In other words, the problem isn't loneliness itself, it's what's said about it, how it's <span class="hl-yellow">interpreted</span>, and the meaning it's given.</p>
    <p class="zh"><u>换句话说，问题不在于孤独本身，而在于人们对它说了什么，如何<span class="hl-yellow">解释</span>它，以及它被赋予的意义。</u></p>

    <p class="en">Today, we live in crowded places and are <span class="hl-orange">incredibly</span> connected to each other, thanks to social media.</p>
    <p class="zh"><u>如今，多亏了社交媒体，我们生活在拥挤的地方，彼此之间有<span class="hl-green">着难以置信</span>的联系。</u></p>

    <p class="en">Nevertheless , it may be that this isn't enough for you, and you feel alone because you're single or live <span class="hl-orange">completely</span> <span class="hl-orange">alone</span>.</p>
    <p class="zh"><u>然而，这对你来说可能还不够，你会感到孤独，因为你单身或者<span class="hl-yellow">完全独居</span>。</u></p>

    <p class="en">However, as we <span class="hl-yellow">mentioned</span> earlier, that isn't the problem.</p>
    <p class="zh"><u>然而，正如我们之前<span class="hl-orange">提到</span>的，这不是问题。</u></p>

    <p class="en">It's your way of seeing it and the <span class="hl-orange">dialogue</span> you're having with yourself about it that's the issue.</p>
    <p class="zh"><u>问题在于你看待它的方式和你与自己的<span class="hl-orange">对话</span>。</u></p>

    <p class="en">That's what makes you feel anxious, <span class="hl-orange">depressed</span>, and empty inside.</p>
    <p class="zh"><u>这就是让你感到焦虑、<span class="hl-orange">沮丧</span>和内心空虚的原因。</u></p>

    <p class="en">Obviously, if you tell yourself a hundred times a day or more, that being alone is a terrible thing, that nobody loves you, and you'll <span class="hl-green">end up</span> dying alone, your emotions will be extremely <span class="hl-orange">intense</span> and you'll feel <span class="hl-orange">dreadful</span> because of these ideas and thoughts that don't even <span class="hl-green">correspond with</span> reality.</p>
    <p class="zh"><u>显然，如果你每天告诉自己一百次或更多次，孤独是一件可怕</u></p>
  </div>

  <div class="right-col">
    <p class="vocab">
      <span class="hl-orange">irrational:</span><br>
      adj.非理性<br>
      的，不合理<br>
      的，荒谬的<br>
      同义词:<br>
      <span class="hl-green">unreasonable</span>
    </p>
    <p class="vocab">
      <span class="hl-orange">surround:</span> v.<br>
      环绕，围绕
    </p>
    <p class="vocab">
      <span class="hl-orange">interpret:</span>v.<br>
      诠释；说明
    </p>
    <p class="vocab">
      <span class="hl-orange">incredibly:</span>ad<br>
      v.<br>
      极端地，非常<br>
      地
    </p>
    <p class="vocab">
      <span class="hl-orange">completely:</span><br>
      adv.彻底地；<br>
      完全地；完整<br>
      地
    </p>
    <p class="vocab">
      <span class="hl-pink">alone:</span>adv.单<br>
      独，独自；<br>
      <span class="hl-green">go it alone</span><br>
      独力；独自<br>
      干；单干
    </p>
    <p class="vocab">
      <span class="hl-pink">loneliness:</span>n.<br>
      孤独；寂寞
    </p>
    <p class="vocab">
      <span class="hl-pink">lonely:</span>adj.<br>
      <span class="hl-green">lonely life /</span><br>
      <span class="hl-green">existence</span>
    </p>
    <p class="vocab">
      <span class="hl-orange">end up :</span>最<br>
      终；结果；
    </p>
    <p class="vocab">
      <span class="hl-orange">correspond:</span><br>
      V.符合；相一<br>
      致;通信
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
